            },
            "text": {
              "expr": {
                "Literal": {
                  "Value": "'Uplift\nMatch-day sales ÷ normal-day sales at a typical crowd.\n\nForecast\nForecast units on match day, made the day before the order.\n\nOn hand\nStock left on the shelf at close the day before delivery. Bakes start from zero each day.\n\nUsual order\nWhat the owner actually ordered for this delivery, using the 28-day-average rule.\n\nRecommended order\nForecast until the next delivery × buffer, minus stock on hand, rounded up to whole cases. The small number is the change against the usual order.\n\nStatus rules\nOrder more: recommendation is 15%+ above usual.\nOver-ordered: usual is 1.5× the recommendation.\nSells out – order more: runs out on most match days.\nDemand hidden – trial +50%: sold out almost every match, so the data can''t show true demand.\n\nSold\nWhat actually sold on match day. \"Sold out\" means the shelf emptied, so demand was higher than this number.'"
                }
              }
            },
